{"step_index":844,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-04T00:35:17Z","thinking":"**Interpreting Korean Business Registrations**\n\nKorean business registration numbers' middle two digits provide key insights into entity type. Individual proprietorships are indicated by digits 01-79, while specific entity types such as for-profit corporations (81, 86, 87, 88) are uniquely identified. This pattern recognition allows categorization of business entities based on registration number structure.\n\n\n**Investigating Incorrect Corporate Numbers**\n\nAnalysis reveals instances where registration numbers intended for for-profit entities are erroneously associated with individual proprietorships, indicated by incorrect middle digits. The inconsistency likely stems from data scraping where generic company names led to the retrieval of unrelated registered corporations with similar names. These mismatched entries were integrated into the dataset before review.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"node -e \\\"\\nconst fs = require('fs');\\n\\nconst lines = fs.readFileSync('merged_500_perfect.tsv', 'utf-8').split('\\\\n').filter(l => l.trim().length > 0);\\n\\nlet fixedCount = 0;\\nconst cleanedLines = lines.map((l, idx) => {\\n  const p = l.split('\\\\t');\\n  const bizno = p[3].trim();\\n  const middle = parseInt(bizno.substring(3, 5), 10);\\n  const isPersonal = middle >= 1 && middle <= 79;\\n  \\n  if (isPersonal && p[13] && p[13].trim() !== '') {\\n    // Clear invalid corporate number for personal business\\n    p[13] = '';\\n    // Also clear settlement month if it was auto-estimated for corporation\\n    p[14] = '';\\n    fixedCount++;\\n  }\\n  return p.join('\\\\t');\\n});\\n\\nconsole.log('Fixed invalid corporate numbers in personal businesses count:', fixedCount);\\nfs.writeFileSync('merged_500_perfect.tsv', cleanedLines.join('\\\\n'), 'utf-8');\\n\\\"\"","Cwd":"\"c:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\resilient-bardeen\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"2000","toolAction":"\"Cleaning invalid corpNo for personal businesses\"","toolSummary":"\"Clear corpNo for individual businesses\""}}]}
