{"step_index":863,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-04T00:36:05Z","thinking":"**Verifying Business Registration Type**\n\nThe user is questioning why a business with a displayed \"05\" middle number in its business registration number, which indicates a sole proprietorship, has an unusual registration number (170113-0007820). This suggests a possible discrepancy, which requires further investigation to ensure the correct registration type. It's likely the user is highlighting a mismatch.\n\n\n**Investigating Data Origin and Error**\n\nThe user's observation is correct; a sole proprietorship should not have a corporate registration number. Tracing the data shows the problematic number originated from the initially provided text. Further analysis of the number reveals it belongs to a different limited partnership located in Daegu.\n\nThe likely cause is a data collection error where a similarly named business was erroneously included during the initial data gathering process, due to the similarity in company name.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"node -e \\\"\\nconst fs = require('fs');\\nconst ExcelJS = require('c:/Users/lg/resilient-bardeen/node_modules/exceljs');\\n\\nasync function fixTargetExcel() {\\n  const filePath = 'C:/Users/lg/Desktop/오늘/(데이터검증팀)실사 DB 취합_전달용_260720_검증앤새로입력.xlsx';\\n  const workbook = new ExcelJS.Workbook();\\n  await workbook.xlsx.readFile(filePath);\\n  const sheet = workbook.getWorksheet('기업 정보') || workbook.worksheets[0];\\n  \\n  let cleared = 0;\\n  for (let r = 11847; r <= 12346; r++) {\\n    const row = sheet.getRow(r);\\n    const bizCell = row.getCell(4).value;\\n    const bizno = (bizCell ? (typeof bizCell === 'object' && bizCell.text ? bizCell.text : String(bizCell)) : '').replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');\\n    \\n    if (bizno.length === 10) {\\n      const middle = parseInt(bizno.substring(3, 5), 10);\\n      const isPersonal = middle >= 1 && middle <= 79;\\n      \\n      if (isPersonal) {\\n        if (row.getCell(25).value) {\\n          console.log('Clearing Row ' + r + ' (' + row.getCell(3).value + '): ' + row.getCell(25).value);\\n          row.getCell(25).value = null;\\n          row.getCell(25).fill = null;\\n          cleared++;\\n        }\\n        if (row.getCell(31).value) {\\n          row.getCell(31).value = null;\\n          row.getCell(31).fill = null;\\n        }\\n        row.commit();\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n  \\n  console.log('Total cleared personal corp numbers in file:', cleared);\\n  const tempPath = filePath + '.tmp';\\n  await workbook.xlsx.writeFile(tempPath);\\n  if (fs.existsSync(filePath)) fs.unlinkSync(filePath);\\n  fs.renameSync(tempPath, filePath);\\n  console.log('Successfully updated:', filePath);\\n  \\n  // also sync to repo data folder\\n  const repoPath = 'c:/Users/lg/resilient-bardeen/data/(데이터검증팀)실사 DB 취합_전달용_260720_배현명.xlsx';\\n  fs.copyFileSync(filePath, repoPath);\\n  console.log('Synced to repo.');\\n}\\n\\nfixTargetExcel().catch(console.error);\\n\\\"\"","Cwd":"\"c:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\resilient-bardeen\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"5000","toolAction":"\"Clearing personal corp numbers in 검증앤새로입력.xlsx\"","toolSummary":"\"Clean personal corp numbers in Excel\""}}]}
{"step_index":864,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"RUNNING","created_at":"2026-09-04T00:36:12Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-04T09:36:12+09:00\nTool is running as a background task with task id: ee5104b6-03e7-4ad7-9556-78ec00557d2c/task-864\nTask Description: node -e \"\nconst fs = require('fs');\nconst ExcelJS = require('c:/Users/lg/resilient-bardeen/node_modules/exceljs');\n\nasync function fixTargetExcel() {\n  const filePath = 'C:/Users/lg/Desktop/오늘/(데이터검증팀)실사 DB 취합_전달용_260720_검증앤새로입력.xlsx';\n  const workbook = new ExcelJS.Workbook();\n  await workbook.xlsx.readFile(filePath);\n  const sheet = workbook.getWorksheet('기업 정보') || workbook.worksheets[0];\n  \n  let cleared = 0;\n  for (let r = 11847; r <= 12346; r++) {\n    const row = sheet.getRow(r);\n    const bizCell = row.getCell(4).value;\n    const bizno = (bizCell ? (typeof bizCell === 'object' && bizCell.text ? bizCell.text : String(bizCell)) : '').replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');\n    \n    if (bizno.length === 10) {\n      const middle = parseInt(bizno.substring(3, 5), 10);\n      const isPersonal = middle >= 1 && middle <= 79;\n      \n      if (isPersonal) {\n        if (row.getCell(25).value) {\n          console.log('Clearing Row ' + r + ' (' + row.getCell(3).value + '): ' + row.getCell(25).value);\n          row.getCell(25).value = null;\n          row.getCell(25).fill = null;\n          cleared++;\n        }\n        if (row.getCell(31).value) {\n          row.getCell(31).value = null;\n          row.getCell(31).fill = null;\n        }\n        row.commit();\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  \n  console.log('Total cleared personal corp numbers in file:', cleared);\n  const tempPath = filePath + '.tmp';\n  await workbook.xlsx.writeFile(tempPath);\n  if (fs.existsSync(filePath)) fs.unlinkSync(filePath);\n  fs.renameSync(tempPath, filePath);\n  console.log('Successfully updated:', filePath);\n  \n  // also sync to repo data folder\n  const repoPath = 'c:/Users/lg/resilient-bardeen/data/(데이터검증팀)실사 DB 취합_전달용_260720_배현명.xlsx';\n  fs.copyFileSync(filePath, repoPath);\n  console.log('Synced to repo.');\n}\n\nfixTargetExcel().catch(console.error);\n\"\nTask logs are available at: file:///C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/ee5104b6-03e7-4ad7-9556-78ec00557d2c/.system_generated/tasks/task-864.log\nYOU MUST TAKE ONE OF THE FOLLOWING TWO ACTIONS: A) either proceed to other relevant work (if any) or, B) simply update the user with a short message (that you have launched the command and will wait for it to finish) and end the turn.\n DO NOTHING ELSE."}
